WEBVTT

NOTE
This is the X-ATM092 activation and Dollet chase sequence.
An iconic action scene featuring the massive mechanical spider robot pursuing SeeD candidates.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 13 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Deep within or near the Communication Tower, the massive X-ATM092 mechanical spider robot begins to power up. Its enormous metallic body dominates the space — a four-legged mechanical arachnid the size of a building. The machine's design is angular and imposing, with thick metal legs and a reinforced carapace. Red glowing eyes illuminate on the front of the robot's head, scanning its surroundings. Mechanical systems activate with grinding sounds and electrical hums. The robot's awakening creates an immediate sense of mortal danger.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
The X-ATM092 rises to full height on its four mechanical legs. Each leg is a complex assembly of articulated metal segments capable of supporting the robot's massive weight. The robot moves forward with terrifying intent, its metal feet crashing against the stone and concrete surfaces beneath it. The walls of nearby buildings shake from the impact of its movement. The red eyes glow brighter as targeting systems activate. The mechanical spider begins pursuing the SeeD candidates through the streets of Dollet.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
Squall, Zell, and Selphie run desperately through the narrow streets of Dollet, weaving between buildings and around corners. The medieval and colonial architecture of the town provides poor shelter against the advancing mechanical horror. The X-ATM092 crashes through obstacles with devastating force. A building in its path crumbles under its metallic foot. Debris and dust explode outward. The robot's legs are visible from multiple angles as it relentlessly pursues the fleeing soldiers.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
The SeeD candidates race down a cobblestone street as the mechanical spider looms behind them. The X-ATM092's massive legs stamp into the ground, creating impact craters in the stone. One of its front legs swings sideways, demolishing a building section. The collapse sends a cloud of dust and rubble across the street. The machine's relentless pursuit shows no mercy — it drives forward, destroying anything in its path that might slow it.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
Squall and his squad reach a bridge spanning an elevated section of Dollet. They sprint across the narrow structure as the X-ATM092 approaches. The mechanical spider's weight shakes the bridge as it begins to cross. Metal girders strain under the robot's immense mass. One of the bridge's support structures cracks visibly. The robot smashes through part of the bridge railing with one of its powerful legs, showering the streets below with debris.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
The bridge partially collapses under the X-ATM092's weight, but the robot continues its relentless advance, using its mechanical legs to navigate the broken structure. The candidates jump the gap left by the collapsed section, landing hard on the far side. The robot's red eyes remain fixed on them. The pursuit continues through increasingly narrow streets and alleyways. The destruction the X-ATM092 leaves in its wake is catastrophic — collapsed buildings, shattered stone, and splintered wood.

01:00.000 --> 01:13.000
The SeeD candidates burst out of the narrow streets into more open ground. The mechanical spider emerges behind them, towering above the rooftops, its silhouette terrifying against the orange sunset sky. The robot's legs crunch through more of Dollet's buildings as it maintains its pursuit. The sheer scale of the machine becomes apparent — it's taller than the three-story buildings surrounding it. The scene ends with the candidates racing forward with the unstoppable X-ATM092 closing the distance behind them, the fate of the mission hanging in the balance.
